sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant WebApp as Web App (Next.js)
    participant Middleware as Next.js Middleware
    participant APIGateway as API Gateway
    participant AuthSvc as Auth Service
    participant ScannerSvc as Scanner Service
    participant Queue as BullMQ + Redis
    participant Worker as Scan Worker
    participant AI as NVIDIA NIM (LLM)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Notification as Notification Svc

    User->>WebApp: 1. Create Project + Start Scan
    WebApp->>Middleware: 2. Request (with session)
    Middleware->>Middleware: 3. Validate JWT + RateLimit + OrgScope
    Middleware->>APIGateway: 4. Forward to POST /api/projects/{id}/scans
    APIGateway->>AuthSvc: 5. requireVerifiedEmail + requireProjectAccess
    AuthSvc->>DB: 6. Verify org membership + permissions
    DB-->>AuthSvc: 7. User + Project + Org
    AuthSvc-->>APIGateway: 8. Authorized
    APIGateway->>DB: 9. Create Scan (status=pending)
    APIGateway->>Queue: 10. Enqueue scan job (priority)
    APIGateway-->>WebApp: 11. 202 Accepted + Scan ID
    WebApp-->>User: 12. Scan queued

    Note over Queue,Worker: ASYNC PROCESSING

    Worker->>Queue: 13. Dequeue scan job
    Worker->>DB: 14. Update Scan status=running
    Worker->>Worker: 15. Launch Puppeteer + crawl pages
    loop For each page
        Worker->>Worker: 16. Run axe-core analysis
        Worker->>DB: 17. Batch insert Violations
    end
    Worker->>DB: 18. Update Scan status=completed + summary
    Worker->>Queue: 19. Enqueue remediation jobs (per violation)

    Note over Queue,RemediationSvc: REMEDIATION PIPELINE

    Worker->>Queue: 20. Dequeue remediation job
    Worker->>DB: 21. Fetch Violation + elementHtml
    alt AI Available
        Worker->>AI: 22. Call NVIDIA NIM (chat/completions)
        AI-->>Worker: 23. Structured response (code + explanation + confidence)
        Worker->>Worker: 24. Parse + validate response
    else AI Unavailable
        Worker->>Worker: 25. Template fallback (WCAG_RULES)
    end
    Worker->>DB: 26. Update Violation (remediationCode, aiExplanation, confidence)
    Worker->>Queue: 27. Enqueue notification (violation.fixed)

    Note over Notification,User: REAL-TIME UPDATES

    Notification->>Redis: 28. Publish domain event (SSE)
    Redis->>WebApp: 29. SSE push to connected clients
    WebApp->>User: 30. Live update (scan progress, new violations, fixes)